url: "https://dwipddalal.github.io/AgentNav/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Utkarsh-Mishra444/Sparsely-Grounded-Long-Range-Navigation"
abstract: >-
  AgentNav uses Verbalization of Path to elicit world knowledge from multimodal
  large language models for visual navigation. CityNav evaluates navigation in
  New York, Tokyo, Vienna, and São Paulo. The EACL 2026 paper and the arXiv preprint
  City Navigation in the Wild: Exploring Emergent Navigation from Web-Scale Knowledge
  in MLLMs (arXiv:2512.15933, 2025) are versions of the same work.
keywords:
  - AgentNav
  - CityNav
  - visual navigation
  - multimodal large language models
  - Verbalization of Path
